                <Title>Biulleten' Vsesoiuznogo kardiologicheskogo nauchnogo tsentra AMN SSSR</Title>
                <ISOAbbreviation>Biull Vsesoiuznogo Kardiol Nauchn Tsentra AMN SSSR</ISOAbbreviation>
